  "$additions": "border, line-height and the sizes listed under size.$sources were added in the repository and approved by the owner on 2026-11-12; each $sources entry names the board or design line it comes from. Also approved the same day, from WherePop.dc.html, for every pop-over, sheet and drawer: radius.popover (14), color.popover-border and color.overlay-shadow (WherePop's values in both themes; the tablet board's 0.35 shadow was an inconsistency). size.map-figure (280) approved the same day. Round 6, approved 2026-11-13, from round6/boards/Locator.dc.html: size.slideout (840), size.slideout-tablet (700) and color.slideout-scrim (Locator's scrim in both themes, which dims only the step list). size.preview-max (240) approved at the round 6 gate review the same day; color.popover-surface (Locator.dc.html and WherePop.dc.html: #1b212b dark, #ffffff light) and size.navigator-max (120) at the second gate review; color.toggle-knob (Views.dc.html, the Settings toggle: #ffffff in both themes) in batch 3.",
  "border": {
    "$sources": { "thin": "boards: 1px borders on cards, rows and fields (Checklist.dc.html and every board)", "thick": "boards: 2px rings and outlines (Checklist.dc.html status rings, Views.dc.html)", "bar": "Views.dc.html: the current step's 4px accent bar (inset 4px 0 0)" },
    "thin": 1, "thick": 2, "bar": 4
  },
  "line-height": {
    "$sources": { "tight": "Views.dc.html: titles (line-height 1.2)", "snug": "Checklist.dc.html: rows and short text (line-height 1.45)", "normal": "Views.dc.html: paragraphs (line-height 1.5)" },
    "tight": 1.2, "snug": 1.45, "normal": 1.5
  },
